    {"symbol": "🪞", "tooltip": "Experience-rating is a rear-view mirror — it can only price the harms already behind you, never the emergent one ahead."},
    {"symbol": "🚪", "tooltip": "Per-layer pricing gives victims N doors, but none of them opens onto the room where the design trade-off was made."}
  ],
