    {"claim": "A compensation pool funded by a revenue-scaled levy on deployers, not a fixed capital reserve.", "targets": ["AN-24"]},
    {"claim": "No one files for a marginally biased credit score they never learned was biased.", "targets": ["AN-22"]},
    {"claim": "An entity that enforces a contract is a plaintiff. An entity that holds assets against creditors is a property-holder.", "targets": ["AN-21"]},
    {"claim": "What does the legal status do that a mandatory disclosure rail plus a public compensation pool does not already do — except give the humans who profited a budgeted ceiling on what they owe?", "targets": ["AN-21", "AN-24"]}
  ],
  "taxonomy_refs": ["skp-beliefs-219", "skp-beliefs-141", "skp-beliefs-029", "skp-desires-078", "skp-beliefs-001", "skp-beliefs-196"]
