    {"claim": "That extra legal hop between the injured stranger and the humans who profited is not a cure for the moral crumple zone — it is the crumple zone, formalized and pre-funded.", "targets": ["AN-5"]},
    {"claim": "Bonded, insured, capitalized shells are cheapest for the four largest firms to stand up and most expensive for the startup to afford — the shell is the incumbent moat.", "targets": []},
    {"claim": "A faster check is a faster discount window, not justice — and the disclosed operational shell does nothing to close the causation-proof gap that lets the upstream designer walk.", "targets": ["AN-5"]}
