    {"claim": "Per-layer capitalized interfaces give the plaintiff a reachable, named payer at every node, so the plaintiff never has to prove which weight fired — name the harm a bare deployer reaches in a layered chain that per-layer interfaces do not.", "targets": ["AN-11"]},
