    {"claim": "A premium priced and passed through deters nothing — it is a fine absorbed as a line item, wearing an actuary's signature.", "targets": ["AN-9"]},
    {"claim": "A reachable payer is not a responsible author.", "targets": ["AN-11"]},
    {"claim": "A piercing rule that can be structured around is a policy decoupled from enforcement capacity.", "targets": ["AN-6"]},
    {"claim": "The duty survives delegation only if you can trace an engineering change at the design layer back to a standard of care.", "targets": ["AN-9", "AN-11", "AN-13"]}
